OL,3,GNEWSAReform leader says first
OL,4,Aminister's priorities 'insulting' after
OL,5,Aspeech at independence rally
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth is facing opposition
OL,8,Fleaders and Senedd members for the
OL,9,Flatest First Minister's Questions
OL,10,F(FMQs)
OL,12,FThe sessions started with the Senedd's
OL,13,Fpresiding officer saying he reprimanded
OL,14,FReform's Joe Martin for his "language"
OL,15,Fand "manner" during a contribution over
OL,16,Fgender services last week
OL,18,FReform Wales leader Helen Jenner
OL,19,Fcriticises the first minister for
OL,20,Fattending a pro-independence rally and
OL,21,Fsays his priorities for the country are
OL,22,F"insulting"
